data: {"id": "dad7a4e5b0c74ab3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1113", "run_id": "dad7a4e5b0c74ab3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 状态**：Pod `aiops-case-v15/workload` 当前 Phase=Running，但 container `app` 处于 `Waiting (CrashLoopBackOff)`，`Ready=False`。重启次数 21 次。\n2. **终止原因**：`Last State` 明确为 `Terminated`，`Reason=OOMKilled`，`Exit Code=137`。最后一段运行仅持续 1 秒（Started 10:49:20 → Finished 10:49:21）。\n3. **容器资源限制**：`limits.memory=64Mi`，`requests.memory=8Mi`。\n4. **容器启动命令**：`python3 -u -c import time; print('startup allocation 256Mi', flush=True); memory=bytearray(256*1024*256); time.sleep(86400)` — 启动后立即尝试分配 **256Mi", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789382994459, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "dad7a4e5b0c74ab3-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "dad7a4e5b0c74ab3", "seq": 1114, "ts_ms": 1789383005663, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 550.025, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v15", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/dad7a4e5b0c74ab3-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "a07fafc0f1fc534b2ba42b14669bf47afc0d3aec845209ed3361f90706f58b75", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "148d40559957102f250731c10c7f3c29dc6f14fe4074758d6464b9f02ea9f1b0"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

