data: {"id": "dad7a4e5b0c74ab3-final", "run_id": "dad7a4e5b0c74ab3", "seq": 1118, "ts_ms": 1789383015748, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload (aiops-case-v15) 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器 app 反复崩溃重启。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `container.last_terminated_reason` | `reason: OOMKilled` | 证实容器因内存超限被操作系统强杀 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `container.waiting_reason` | `reason: CrashLoopBackOff` | 展示容器反复重启失败的最终状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_limit.memory` | `value: 64Mi` | 确立容器允许的内存使用硬上限 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `container.last_exit_code` | `exit_code: 137` | 印证进程被内核 OOM Killer 强制终止 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | `event.message` | `Back-off restarting failed container app` | 描述 Kubernetes 指数退避重试重启的过程 |\n| 6 | K8s State | `container.waiting_message` | `back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app...` | 展示最后一次重试的退避等待时长（5分钟） |\n| 7 | Logging | `log.message` | `startup allocation 256Mi` | 证实启动过程需要分配的内存量远超配置限制 |\n| 8 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` | `reason: OOMKilled` | Prometheus 指标独立印证了 OOM 终止原因 |\n\n**证据链说明：**\nKubernetes 事件与指标（#1, #8）共同锁定终止原因为 OOMKilled；退出码 137（#4）进一步确认这是由外部（内核/系统）强杀进程所致，而非程序内部逻辑错误。日志（#7）揭示了根本冲突：启动分配需求 256Mi 远超配置的内存上限 64Mi（#3）。这种持续的资源超支导致每次启动必败，最终触发 Kubernetes 的重启重试机制陷入 CrashLoopBackOff（#2, #5, #6）的死循环。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用启动分配 256Mi 内存需求 (日志) → 超出 64Mi 的容器硬限制 (K8s Config) → Linux OOM Killer 终止进程 (Exit Code 137) → Kubernetes 反复重启失败 (CrashLoopBackOff)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：应用容器的内存资源限制配置过低（`limits.memory=64Mi`），无法满足应用启动时实际需要的内存大小（`allocation 256Mi`）。\n\n该配置缺陷直接导致进程在启动阶段即触发 OOM Killer（Exit Code 137），进而引发 Kubernetes 的自动重启机制不断尝试失败，形成 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。这一结论由 Kubernetes 终止原因（OOMKilled）、退出码（137）、日志分配的内存数值（256Mi）与资源限制配置（64Mi）之间的数值矛盾及终止事实完全印证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 11.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 550.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v15/workload: 550.0s (Evidence 538.9s, RCA 10.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v15/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 572.065, "metrics": {"run_id": "dad7a4e5b0c74ab3", "mttr": {"value": "9.5m", "seconds": 572.0699698925018, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 572069.9698925018, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 566932.3666095734, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 14415.684461593628, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4576.307535171509}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 11942.087411880493, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 550024.5523452759, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10067.384958267212, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

